Z||000000||loafer87gt||05-20-2000||05:47 PM||||Geez do I ever feel stupid. My e-brake cables have been corroded on my GT so I've been having to leave the car in gear when I leave it so that it doesn't roll. Well, this morning I forgot to put the car in gear and it rolled backwards about 50' into a powerbox. The back bumber is smashed, the wing is cracked, the taillights are smashed to bits, and the decklid is also wrecked. I feel SO bad for my GT, I can't believe I did this to my car. I now have three insurance claims underway from the past two weeks, two from theft, and one from my own stupidity. I guess the search for parts starts once again... I feel like crap guys||||reg||1
