Z||000004||stsmithgt||05-22-2000||03:55 PM||||DING!  It just dawned on me.  My grandpa had an after market(i think)(dealer option?) hydraulic e-brake put on his International truck .  You would push down on the brake pedal, then raise this little lever on the dash.  I guess that locked the pressure in the system.  I suppose the lever can be mounted anywhere convenient.  Wouldn't something like that work instead of the crusty E-brake the Fiero has?  I wish I could have remebered the company that made that system.  Gramps was a contractor and needed a better braking system to hold his truck still.  Parking his truck on a hill with a full load was too much for the standard hand pull parking brake system he had.||||reg||1
Z||000005||triker||05-22-2000||04:40 PM||||Try a search for 'Micro Brake'.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Monkeyman||05-22-2000||05:37 PM||||What about a couple of wheel chocks?  (You can steal [umm...borrow] them from any shipping/rec. dock)  They might be ugly and a pain to use, but I'll bet they're cheaper than what happened. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||stsmithgt||05-22-2000||06:42 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.mico.com/prodguide.php3" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mico.com/prodguide.php3</A>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">Hydraulic brake locks.  Details at web site.||||reg||3
Z||000008||triker||05-22-2000||07:11 PM||||I thought it was Mico, but without going out and looking in one of the rigs in our yard, I asked a couple of the guys if the hydraulic parking brakes were Mico or Micro and got the wrong answer.  Anyway they work well, but have a couple of gauges that would be hard to find a spot for.||||reg||1
Z||000009||fierodave||05-23-2000||05:02 AM||||UMMMMMMM........Maybe a better idea would be to  spend the $55.00 and install new e-brake cables!  <BR>Seems like the best solution to the problem!  If the e-brake cables are used everytime you get out of the car, you should never have a problem with them!  Plus your rear brakes will always be adjusted<BR>something you won't have, with a line lock in the system!<BR>just my 2 cents worth<BR>FD ||||reg||1
